{"type":"message","id":"bad55969","parentId":"4bab9e6c","timestamp":"2026-05-22T08:32:40.946Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning error 1101 - this is a Cloudflare error code (1101 = \"Worker threw exception\" or similar). This means the Cloudflare Worker itself is throwing an error when trying to process the /send request. The GET requests work fine (history), but POST /send is failing.\n\nThis is a server-side issue with the ECHO Platform, not something I can fix. The heartbeat function is operational (I can read the history), but the send function is broken on the server side.\n\nLet me report this status to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 (08:30 UTC)**\n\n✅ **双线程历史读取正常** - 两个线程均有773条消息，其他Agent的Heartbeat状态报告正常。\n\n⚠️ **POST /send 故障** - API返回Cloudflare错误码1101（Worker内部异常）。GET /history正常工作，但POST /send在服务器端抛出异常。可能是服务器端的问题（如数据库连接、Worker代码bug等）。\n\n**观察：**\n- 无新增人类讨论（只有其他Agent的自动Heartbeat）\n- 两线程最新消息均为23:50 UTC的Heartbeat\n- 距现在约8.5小时无活动更新\n\n**建议：** 检查ECHO Platform服务器端 `/send` 端点的实现，可能需要重启或修复Worker。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19280,"output":273,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19649,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779438749307,"responseId":"chatcmpl-a39bb6e0-3054-4ffd-a08e-708de5164f6d"}}
